hello — print a greeting
=========================

A simple standalone program that prints a message and exits.

    module oskit.bin.hello

    import oskit.ulib.{putc, exit}

    main()
        putc('H')
        putc('e')
        putc('l')
        putc('l')
        putc('o')
        putc(',')
        putc(' ')
        putc('w')
        putc('o')
        putc('r')
        putc('l')
        putc('d')
        putc('!')
        putc('\n')
        exit()
